{"unit_id":"cjc-github__dsh-model-provider-picker#card-zh","repo":"cjc-github/dsh-model-provider-picker","commit":"d51324a2cb5e515070e2071a98b9555284fb1df5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-provider-picker 是面向 DSH Web 的模型管理插件，在 composer 模型位提供厂商优先的两级选择器，并增加专用设置页。用户可按厂商展开并选择模型、搜索厂商或模型、选择模型推理等级，也能分别隐藏厂商和单个模型。设置页包含常见厂商预设，可创建、编辑和删除提供方配置，并从接口发现模型；另可选择开启本地 API Key 回显。适合需要整理模型目录、管理可见模型或添加自定义模型服务的 DSH Web 用户。预设调用需用户自行配置相应厂商凭证；凭证回显默认关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:5-8","lib/client.js:625-654","lib/client.js:911-1036"]}
{"unit_id":"cjc-github__dsh-model-provider-picker#card-en","repo":"cjc-github/dsh-model-provider-picker","commit":"d51324a2cb5e515070e2071a98b9555284fb1df5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-provider-picker adds a provider-first model picker to DSH Web with search, reasoning levels, and visibility controls. Its settings page supports presets, custom APIs, profile editing, and model discovery. Users supply credentials as needed; optional local key reveal is off by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:5-8","lib/client.js:625-654","lib/client.js:911-1036"]}
