{"unit_id":"cjc-github__dsh-model-provider-picker#caveat-1","repo":"cjc-github/dsh-model-provider-picker","commit":"d51324a2cb5e515070e2071a98b9555284fb1df5","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-provider-picker 使用前须知：凭证回显默认关闭；开启后会读取本地 API Key 并投影到设置数据，源码注明这些值可能落入 profile 的 cordis.patch.yml，关闭开关会清空映射。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:14-26","lib/index.js:71-82","lib/index.js:120-128"]}
